Must be part of a big band.

00:25:31.560 --> 00:25:35.720
Hey there, big guy. Would it be too much to ask if I borrowed your gavel?

00:25:37.570 --> 00:25:39.710
Order in the court. Order in the court.

00:25:40.780 --> 00:25:43.900
Judging by the size of this, I'd be a big hit on the bench.

00:25:45.250 --> 00:25:47.920
Or tops in my art class.

00:25:48.980 --> 00:25:51.100
Am I having some sort of weird dream?

00:25:51.720 --> 00:25:54.060
Have my big ideas gotten the best of me?

00:25:54.650 --> 00:25:58.470
Or am I just in a toy store called KB in La Mesa, California?

00:25:59.470 --> 00:25:59.810
You know?

00:26:00.160 --> 00:26:04.720
If I were to judge myself just by what I see right now, I'd feel awfully small.

00:26:05.040 --> 00:26:07.140
It could make me feel pretty unimportant.

00:26:08.410 --> 00:26:10.210
Boy, that looks so tasty.

00:26:11.990 --> 00:26:13.980
Wow, thanks.

00:26:16.400 --> 00:26:19.370
I know I have a huge appetite, but this is ridiculous.

00:26:19.750 --> 00:26:29.680
I hope my eyes aren't bigger than my stomach.

00:26:30.920 --> 00:26:31.980
I'll take that banana, too.

00:26:34.730 --> 00:26:37.150
Sometimes even the real world can make me feel small.

00:26:38.690 --> 00:26:39.470
Thank you.

00:26:40.540 --> 00:26:44.420
But you can't measure yourself by the people or things standing next to you.

00:26:44.580 --> 00:26:47.580
There's always going to be somebody bigger or smaller than you are.

00:26:48.580 --> 00:26:48.880
Thanks.

00:26:56.130 --> 00:26:59.910
The only way to really know how big and important you are is to look inside.

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:07.240
yourself. The things around you aren't nearly as important as how you see yourself. Some people say

00:27:07.240 --> 00:27:13.990
the best things come in small packages. Others say bigger is better. It all depends on how you

00:27:13.990 --> 00:27:21.850
look at it. See you next time. See you next time. See you next time. See you next time.

00:27:31.560 --> 00:27:32.080
Thank you.
